MSN:iron1516:MG3:Hint:1
"Hint 1. Hold down the mouse wheel to rotate the camera."
END

MSN:iron1516:MG3:Hint:2
"Hint 2. You need to learn how to use a shield against Tesla fighters and Natasha."
END

MSN:iron1516:MG3:Hint:3
"Hint 3. Engineers need to be found to fix bridges. Behind the bridges are the oil rigs you need. Good luck!"
END

MSN:iron1516:MG3:Missions:1
"Mission 1. P1 must have 5000 or more money. P2 should have 5000 and more money. Each player must have at least 1 oil rig captured. Mission 2. Destroy the Soviet bunker! Good luck!"
END

MSN:iron1516:MG3:Hint:4
"Beep means that Natasha is close"
END